    "text": "THE regulation for the Uththama Seva Padakkama published in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 156/5 dated 01st September1981 and Extraordinary Gazette No. 1692/29 dated 11th February, 2011 are hereby amended by the substitution of thefollowing new paragraph 5 to be effective only for the year 2018, 2019 and year 2020. Therefore in place of Paragraph 5thereof.",
